      "A property buyer does not wait. They see a listing on a portal or on social media, they message the agent, and if nobody replies within minutes they message the next agent with a similar property. Real estate is a speed business, and the agent who answers first usually wins the viewing, and the agent who wins the viewing usually wins the deal. An AI chatbot for real estate is built for exactly that moment: it answers listing enquiries instantly, at any hour, qualifies the buyer, books the viewing, and follows up on WhatsApp until the viewing happens. This guide explains how it works, what it costs, and when it pays for itself.",
