      "What are the ongoing costs after launch?",
      "Budget for hosting, domain renewal, security, schedule and price updates, and content such as service pages and patient information. Care retainers at CINEM are $499, $1,499 or $3,999 per month depending on the level of support. A chatbot for patient enquiries is available from $999 setup plus $299 per month, and an AI calling agent from $1,499 setup plus $399 per month.",
      "If your clinic website is not bringing you appointments, it is worth an honest look at why. Tell CINEM at hello@cinem.tech how many patients you see each week, what happens to an enquiry today, and what patients ask most often. We will scope the right build, from a fast marketing website to a full booking system with reminders and WhatsApp enquiries, and price it honestly with the running costs included."
