      "If you are an agent or an agency and your website is not bringing you viewings, it is worth an honest look at why. Tell CINEM at hello@cinem.tech how many listings you have, where they come from, and what happens to an enquiry today. We will scope the right build, from a fast marketing website to a full portal-fed platform with WhatsApp enquiries, and price it honestly with the running costs included."
