      "Should a clinic take deposits on a booking website?",
      "Often yes, for new patients and for longer appointments. A small deposit reduces no-shows and gives the clinic a fair cancellation policy to point to. The booking flow should make the deposit amount, the refund rule and the reschedule option clear before the patient pays.",
