      "It is cheaper to start, because you pay a monthly fee instead of a build cost. Over two or three years, the monthly fees and any per-booking commission often add up to more than a custom build, and you still do not own the site. If booking is central to your business, custom usually wins on total cost.",
      "How much does it cost to run a booking website each month?",
