      "A landing page is the smallest thing a business can buy that still has to do a real job: turn a stranger who clicked an ad into an enquiry, a booking, or a sale. That is why its price is so confusing. A landing page can cost nothing, or $10,000, and both quotes can be honest — because one is a page and the other is a conversion system with copywriting, design, testing, and tracking. This guide sets out what a landing page really costs in 2026, what separates a cheap page from one that converts, and how to budget for the page and the ads that drive traffic to it.",
