      "A single landing page from CINEM sits inside our website packages, which start from $1,499, and is usually built as part of a lead generation campaign — our lead generation service is $599 a month plus ad spend — because a landing page without traffic is a poster in an empty room. The rest of this guide explains what the money buys, and what to demand at any price.",
      "## What a landing page is — and what it is not",
