      "What are the ongoing monthly costs of an online store?",
      "The platform subscription, paid apps, payment gateway fees of around 2–3% per order, and maintenance. A small store typically pays $30–$300 a month in platform and app fees, plus payment fees that scale with sales, plus maintenance from $499 a month on a care plan.",
